The model generated (Retain_Transformer.py) uses the predefined pyhealth mortalitypredictionmimic3 task
for data preparation, and passes through both a RETAIN (dual RNN) layer and a Transformer layer to predict 
a binary value of mortality based on past data. 

The baseline model (baseline.py) uses the predefined pyhealth pipeline to implement an RNN 

Ablation studies are performed on the custom model, with ablate_retain.py bypassing the retain layer, and 
ablate_transformer.py bypassing the transformer layer. 

Test dataset results for the best epoch (50 total epochs) of each model are printed in the corresponding .txt file

